# Testing

## Stack

- Web: Vitest + React Testing Library + Playwright
- Mobile: Jest + React Testing Library + Detox
- Packages: Vitest

## Test Organization (Hybrid)

| Type | Location | Purpose |
|------|----------|---------|
| Unit | Co-located `*.test.ts` | Single function/component |
| Integration | `__tests__/integration/` | Multi-feature flows |
| E2E | `e2e/` | Full user journeys |
| Utilities | `src/test/` | Mocks, factories, setup |

## AAA Pattern

```typescript
it('should do something', () => {
  // Arrange - Set up test data
  // Act - Execute code
  // Assert - Verify outcome
});
```

## Commands

- `pnpm test` - Run all
- `pnpm --filter [app] test` - Run specific
- `pnpm --filter @repo/core test` - Test core package

## Rules

- Test behavior, not implementation
- Accessible queries (getByRole, getByLabelText)
- Co-locate unit tests with source files
- Coverage: 70%+ components, 80%+ packages

## Service Testing

```typescript
// Mock the HttpClient adapter
const mockHttp: HttpClient = {
  get: vi.fn(),
  post: vi.fn(),
  put: vi.fn(),
  patch: vi.fn(),
  delete: vi.fn(),
};
const service = createAccountsService(mockHttp);
```

